msgid "SMP 整机测量与输入身份"
msgstr "Whole-system SMP measurement and input identity"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_smp_latency_qemu.py`` 在单独复制的系统镜像中运行有限次工作负载， 不构建内核或获取软件包。开始前需准备独立、不可变的 root ``kernel-"
"payload`` 目录和与之匹配的 ESP ``boot-payload`` 目录，以及已安装官方 GCC、make、musl 开发头文件、binutils、FFmpeg（含 "
"libx264）、Xorg 和 IceWM 的来宾磁盘。宿主机 需要 QEMU、e2fsprogs、dosfstools、mtools、``grub-editenv``、目标 musl "
"sysroot、正式 SDK 和 目标 X11 开发文件。源镜像可以是 raw 或单文件 VMDK；外部 extent 和 backing 链无法由单个文件哈希标识，因此会被拒绝。 "
"源盘如果已含所选 release 的内核或模块目录，工具也会拒绝注入，避免保留 清单之外的旧文件；请使用不含该 release 的干净用户态镜像。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_smp_latency_qemu.py`` runs a bounded number of workloads in a separately copied "
"system image; it does not build kernels or fetch packages. Prepare separate, immutable root "
"``kernel-payload`` and matching ESP ``boot-payload`` directories, plus a guest disk with official "
"GCC, make, musl development headers, binutils, FFmpeg (including libx264), Xorg, and IceWM "
"installed. The host needs QEMU, e2fsprogs, dosfstools, mtools, ``grub-editenv``, the target musl "
"sysroot, official SDK, and target X11 development files. Source images may be raw or single-file "
"VMDK; external extents and backing chains cannot be identified by one file hash and are rejected. "
"Injection is also rejected if the source disk already contains a kernel or module directory for "
"the selected release, to avoid retaining old files outside the manifest. Use a clean userspace "
"image without that release."

msgid "从仓库根目录执行，以下变量由测量者指向已冻结的产物："
msgstr ""
"Run from the repository root; the measurer must point the following variables at frozen artifacts:"

msgid ""
"``--prepare-only`` 只生成镜像，不启动虚拟机；删除该参数才由工具启动拥有的 QEMU 子进程。它发现已有 QEMU 或 VMware 时拒绝启动，使用短路径 QMP "
"socket， 超时或失败时只停止并回收自己的子进程，每次等待均有限时。启动前、负载和 清理失败均写入 ``result.json``，保留失败阶段与清理状态。可用准备好的 raw "
"镜像交由操作者在 VMware 中运行；VMware 的超时控制、串口采集与关闭由操作者负责。离线串口 校验可使用 ``--validate-serial LOG --nonce NONCE "
"--release RELEASE --expect-profiler MODE --repeat N``，身份信息位于 ``prepared.json``。"
msgstr ""
"``--prepare-only`` generates images without starting a VM; remove it to let the tool start its own"
" QEMU child process. It refuses to start if QEMU or VMware is already running, uses a short-path "
"QMP socket, and stops and reaps only its own child on timeout or failure, with bounded waits "
"throughout. Pre-launch, workload, and cleanup failures are written to ``result.json``, preserving "
"the failure stage and cleanup status. Operators may run a prepared raw image in VMware; they are "
"responsible for VMware timeouts, serial capture, and shutdown. Offline serial validation accepts "
"``--validate-serial LOG --nonce NONCE --release RELEASE --expect-profiler MODE --repeat N``; "
"identity data is in ``prepared.json``."

msgid ""
"``--expect-profiler both`` 在已配置诊断节点的同一内核上分别运行 ``off`` 和 ``on``；``on`` 或 ``off`` 只运行其中一种。``absent``"
" 明确要求 ``CONFIG_LOCK_STAT=n`` 的节点不存在，不能作为节点缺失时的自动回退。 ``--jobs 0`` 在固定 32 个翻译单元上使用无参数 ``make "
"-j``；其余取值是作业数。 输出记录配置、镜像和源文件身份，保留准备日志、完整 root 和 ESP 回读、 串口、QEMU 日志以及失败结果。内核、initramfs、模块数据库、两个启动槽、"
" 版本文件和清单在启动前核对；不重写 GRUB 或固件。私有副本中禁用原来的 ``smp-setup``、DHCP、NTP 和图形会话启动链接，并离线删除旧的 :0 socket、 锁文件和 "
"``Xorg.0.log``；源盘不变。来宾将 gcc、make、as、ld、ffmpeg 和 ffprobe 的完整版本输出与退出状态写入串口并保存在解析结果中，缺失或失败 "
"的版本记录会使测量失败。串口原始日志完整保留；解析遥测块时只跳过符合 内核格式的完整 DEBUG/INFO 行，其他异常内容仍使该块失败。"
msgstr ""
"``--expect-profiler both`` runs ``off`` and ``on`` on the same kernel with the diagnostic node "
"configured; ``on`` or ``off`` runs just that mode. ``absent`` explicitly requires the node to be "
"absent with ``CONFIG_LOCK_STAT=n`` and is not an automatic fallback for a missing node. ``--jobs "
"0`` uses argument-free ``make -j`` on a fixed set of 32 translation units; other values specify "
"the job count. Output records configuration, image, and source identities and retains preparation "
"logs, full root and ESP readbacks, serial and QEMU logs, and failure results. The kernel, "
"initramfs, module database, both boot slots, version files, and manifests are checked before "
"launch; GRUB and firmware are not rewritten. In the private copy, existing ``smp-setup``, DHCP, "
"NTP, and graphical-session startup links are disabled, and old :0 sockets, lock files, and "
"``Xorg.0.log`` are removed offline; the source disk is unchanged. The guest writes complete "
"version output and exit status for gcc, make, as, ld, ffmpeg, and ffprobe to serial, retaining "
"them in parsed results. Missing or failed version records fail the measurement. Full raw serial "
"logs are retained; telemetry parsing skips only complete DEBUG/INFO lines matching the kernel "
"format. Other anomalous content still fails the block."

msgid ""
"固定策略是先不采样地编译并编码/解码一次，然后每次清理目标文件重新编译， 每次编码并完整解码固定 640×360、24 fps、5 秒的软件视频；不清空系统缓存。 "
"这些是预热策略下的重复运行，不应标记为冷启动。编译夹具必须输出精确值 ``660e5ee6e1d4b501``；视频必须有 120 帧、正确宽高并完整解码。另有空闲控制 "
"和原生进程/线程内存、COW、暖缓存文件映射与 ``pread`` 负载。任何退出码、 结果检查、样本缺失、超时或来宾崩溃都会使本次结果失败。"
msgstr ""
"The fixed policy first compiles and encodes/decodes once without sampling, then removes object "
"files and rebuilds each time, encoding and fully decoding a fixed 640×360, 24 fps, five-second "
"software video on each run; system caches are not flushed. These are repeated warm-up-policy runs,"
" not cold starts. The compilation fixture must output exactly ``660e5ee6e1d4b501``; video must "
"have 120 frames, correct dimensions, and decode completely. There are also an idle control and "
"native process/thread memory, COW, warm-cache file-mapping, and ``pread`` workloads. Any bad exit "
"status, failed result check, missing sample, timeout, or guest crash fails the run."

msgid ""
"每次负载期间运行真实 Xorg、IceWM 和专用窗口。测试服务使用现有 tty wrapper， 仅在隔离镜像的单个 VT 上启动 Xorg；``-nolisten tcp -ac`` 关闭远程"
" TCP 并 允许隔离系统内的本地客户端连接。X11 数值是客户端定时绘制及 ``XSync`` 服务端 确认的时长，不是物理鼠标、键盘或屏幕扫描输出延迟。程序核对窗口管理器和 "
"实际可见窗口的像素并保存每一个样本；样本使用 ``CLOCK_MONOTONIC`` 纳秒。原生探针也使用 该时钟。X11 探针有独立的有限超时，即使连接或服务端确认卡住也会失败退出。 "
"按样本排序后以 nearest-rank ``ceil(N*p)-1`` （从 0 开始）计算 p50、 p95、p99 和最大值。页故障样本包含探针自己的内容检查和读写开销。"
msgstr ""
"Real Xorg, IceWM, and a dedicated window run during every workload. The test service uses the "
"existing tty wrapper and starts Xorg on only one VT in the isolated image; ``-nolisten tcp -ac`` "
"disables remote TCP and permits local clients within the isolated system. X11 values measure timed"
" client drawing plus ``XSync`` server acknowledgment, not physical mouse, keyboard, or display "
"scanout latency. The program verifies the window manager and pixels of the actually visible window"
" and saves every sample in ``CLOCK_MONOTONIC`` nanoseconds. Native probes use the same clock. The "
"X11 probe has its own finite timeout and fails even if connection or server acknowledgment hangs. "
"Sorted samples use nearest-rank ``ceil(N*p)-1`` with zero-based indexing for p50, p95, p99, and maximum. Page-"
"fault samples include the probe's own content checks and read/write overhead."

msgid ""
"纳秒是存储单位，不表示时钟具有纳秒分辨率。当前多核来宾不假定 TSC 跨 CPU 同步；时钟回退及延迟的 timer IRQ 会影响测量。比较编译吞吐时应 "
"另记录编译区间的宿主单调墙钟和串口观察误差，不能用整个启动/清理耗时 代替编译耗时。X11 round-trip 也不能代替真实拖动、按键和应用操作验收。"
msgstr ""
"Nanoseconds are the storage unit, not a claim of nanosecond clock resolution. Current multicore "
"guests do not assume TSC synchronization across CPUs; clock fallback and delayed timer IRQs affect"
" measurements. For compilation-throughput comparisons, separately record host monotonic wall time "
"for the compilation interval and serial observation error; total boot/cleanup time cannot "
"substitute for compilation time. X11 round trips also cannot replace acceptance testing of actual "
"dragging, keystrokes, and application operations."

msgid ""
"交互验收先确认 IceWM 和终端已经可用，再启动编译。检查标题栏和 Alt 拖动、缩放、最大化/最小化与恢复、释放后的指针移动、终端命令及 Fileman "
"导航。``tools/test_icewm_interactions_qemu.py`` 的截图等待包含宿主图像分析： 1920×1080 的连通区域识别每帧可能超过 2 "
"秒，需允许连续两帧确认；该等待 时间不是来宾输入延迟。冷启动 Xorg/XDM 的等待也与已经运行的桌面分开记录。 最大化的黑色客户区可能与桌面背景连通；应同时用 X11 报告的位置、尺寸和 "
"``map_state`` 核对移动、缩放及最小化。原生窗口状态与实际截图分别留证， 不能以截图识别器没有检测到边界判定窗口管理器未执行操作。"
msgstr ""
"For interactive acceptance testing, first confirm that IceWM and the terminal are usable, then "
"start compilation. Check title-bar and Alt dragging, resizing, maximize/minimize and restore, "
"pointer movement after release, terminal commands, and Fileman navigation. Screenshot waits in "
"``tools/test_icewm_interactions_qemu.py`` include host image analysis: connected-component "
"recognition at 1920×1080 may exceed two seconds per frame, and confirmation needs two consecutive "
"frames. This wait is not guest input latency. Cold-start Xorg/XDM waits are also recorded "
"separately from the running desktop. A maximized black client area can connect to the desktop "
"background; also verify moves, resizing, and minimization against X11 position, dimensions, and "
"``map_state``. Preserve native window state and actual screenshots separately; a screenshot "
"recognizer missing an edge does not show that the window manager failed to act."

msgid "桌面与编译优先级"
msgstr "Desktop and compilation priorities"

msgid ""
"正常图形启动由 root 所有的 ``reliefos-xdm`` 使用现有 BusyBox ``renice`` 将自身设为 nice=-10，XDM、Xorg 的线程及 IceWM "
"继承这个普通调度优先级。 不切换到实时调度。``Xsession`` 在启动 IceWM 后、启动初始终端前将自身 恢复为 nice=0；IceWM 的菜单与快捷键终端入口同样先恢复为 "
"nice=0。 因此终端中执行的 shell、``make -j`` 及其编译器子进程使用正常优先级。 无法调整优先级时仍继续启动会话，不因权限或工具不可用而中断登录。"
msgstr ""
"During normal graphical startup, root-owned ``reliefos-xdm`` uses existing BusyBox ``renice`` to "
"set itself to nice=-10. XDM, Xorg threads, and IceWM inherit this normal scheduling priority; "
"real-time scheduling is not used. After starting IceWM and before starting the initial terminal, "
"``Xsession`` resets itself to nice=0; IceWM menu and shortcut terminal entry points likewise reset"
" to nice=0 first. Shells, ``make -j``, and compiler children launched from terminals therefore run"
" at normal priority. If adjusting priority fails, session startup continues; unavailable "
"permissions or tools do not interrupt login."

msgid ""
"该策略优先处理繁忙时的显示与窗口事件，交互繁忙时可能让出部分编译吞吐。 验收应在正常 XDM 登录链中只读取 ``getpriority`` 的实际值，覆盖 Xorg 的 输入线程、IceWM "
"和终端；由测试脚本临时修改优先级的实验不能代替此检查。 Fileman 导航应核对应用提交后的窗口标题和实际截图，避免仅依赖 OCR 对 中文、路径或小字体的识别结果。"
msgstr ""
"This policy prioritizes display and window events under load and may sacrifice some compilation "
"throughput during heavy interaction. Acceptance testing should only read actual ``getpriority`` "
"values in the normal XDM login chain, covering Xorg input threads, IceWM, and terminals. "
"Experiments that temporarily change priorities from test scripts are not a substitute. For Fileman"
" navigation, check the application-updated window title and actual screenshots instead of relying "
"solely on OCR of Chinese, paths, or small fonts."

msgid ""
"诊断节点使用独立的原始 ``tsc_cycles``，各 CPU 的 TSC 不假定同步，不换算成 用户态延迟。每次先停止采样再重新打开快照；因停止可能截断已取得锁的样本， "
"持锁直方图总数不必等于取得锁总数。任何 ``clock_errors`` 都会使该测量失败。 使用一致的来宾用户态、源文件、作业数、缓存策略、重复次数和检查结果进行 "
"前后比较；失败的行不能用于宣称性能改善。"
msgstr ""
"Diagnostic nodes use separate raw ``tsc_cycles``. CPU TSCs are not assumed synchronized and are "
"not converted to userspace latency. Stop sampling before reopening each snapshot. Stopping can "
"truncate samples whose locks were already acquired, so hold-time histogram totals need not equal "
"total acquisitions. Any ``clock_errors`` fail the measurement. Compare before and after with "
"identical guest userspace, sources, job count, cache policy, repeat count, and result checks; "
"failed rows cannot support performance-improvement claims."
